"593966966655966", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974465_593966973322632_4982309690223554663_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ehlk7BMRACIQ7kNvwFsKY5u&_nc_oc=Ado6PYnFgnnHp5P9wbHEz8s_eoa_hj2hKOU6qt5lGrhSLXRY-8nDGLmJJotoiZ-Hl5I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSzMiQW87DjF97jkI-64SF6Mt709g9wntrv4yTmy94q0w&oe=6AF5CA11"}, {"file_name": "7.png", "id": "1046485386953462", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001725_1046485390286795_4079334239054220795_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GnmS-WePeZgQ7kNvwHYkW6k&_nc_oc=AdrbU62Nm1-mVlEIy69MgTKoI98jlTXfZ_BEOyu7jisd-TSzhChRneazR_Ajx9CqMiM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRrDZ9hLk2PvmHpLMK33HV2bfQ0rchH73rcQVjEU8HS3w&oe=6AF5D177"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "871826811724630", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86620689_871826815057963_7999414902838153684_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pRMzXKhM5DYQ7kNvwF5JcqI&_nc_oc=Adoo6Ned8OshDtxvygiFUBw99OOejh6cPynz6R7qhr4nMvRb5O8vJ4CjndadNuCcauM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSn2aanuEUQxsfbbSeq7nIzcs_VohIL4rg5OuGjSZ9m5Q&oe=6AF5C684"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TacticalAssaultVRTrailerCoverImage.png", "id": "3497936147171850", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75540506_3497936150505183_3880119875800127416_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5jndHRiADssQ7kNvwEeUS98&_nc_oc=AdpyC9qHEZa5NZWwnaYhExyRbTwpKBWbfRtfKjeYKRncTm1sGeJwriOMgX-0PO8kkHo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTc_LZqn8jrK9-GajUXHbY7-Q0NdG0ZpAJuB48JLG79FA&oe=6AF5E696"}, "display_name": "Tactical Assault VR", "keywords": ["TAVR", "Military", "SWAT", "Police", "Tactical"], "long_description": "# Become part of an elite special forces unit in Tactical Assault VR!\n\nTactical Assault VR is an intense tactical shooter where you use real-world CQB (Close Quarters Battles) tactics to stack up, breach doors and eliminate threats. Play solo or join an online co-op special forces unit in missions around the world.\n\n# Features\n**PvE Missions: Solo or Online Multiplayer Co-Op with Up to 6 Players**\n{1487526115258066}\n\n**PvP: Competitive Online Multiplayer**\n{1082589306850803}\n\n**9 Non-Linear Asymmetrical Missions, 3 Wave Shooter Experiences, Room Randomizer & Sandbox Mode**\n\nPlan your assault. The choice is yours.\n{448475627682065}\n\n**Game Mode Variety**\n\nBomb Defusal, Hostage Rescue, Enemy Surrendering, High-Value Target (HVT) Eliminations, Mini Games, Killhouse, Hardcore Mode.\n{1946208202559962}\n\n**60+ Detailed Weapons and Counting**\n\nCustomize your loadout with tactical gear including vests, helmets, weapons, scopes, sights, grips and breaching equipment.\n{1007758587705278}", "short_description": "Tactical Assault VR is an intense tactical shooter where you use real-world CQB (Close Quarters Battles) tactics to stack up, breach doors and eliminate threats. Play solo or join an online co-op special forces unit in missions around the world."}]}, "developer_name": "HammerFire Interactive", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.hammerfireinteractive.net/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "HammerFire Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.hammerfireinteractive.net/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_l